N/A  ([https://supremevalues.com/mm2/ Supreme])}}'''Ornaments''' is an {{C|Uncommon|uncommon}} knife that was obtainable from the [[2025 Christmas Box]] during the [[Christmas Event 2025]] in [[Murder Mystery 2]]. It was also one of the weapons used to craft the [[Bokeh]] effect.

== Appearance ==
Ornaments has a black handle and a blade decorated with a purple background featuring three vertically arranged Christmas ornaments in red, green, and blue, each adorned with a gold top. This festive design makes it a distinctive and collectible item for the holiday event.

